second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which educational institution did Marilyn A. Morris attend?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 22, \"text\": \"**Historian Marilyn A.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 23, \"end\": 81, \"text\": \"Morris's Academic Roots Traced Back to Durham University**\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 83, \"end\": 174, \"text\": \"A thorough examination of the academic background of renowned American historian Marilyn A.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 175, \"end\": 319, \"text\": \"Morris has revealed that she attended Durham University, a prestigious collegiate public research university in Durham, England, United Kingdom.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 320, \"end\": 477, \"text\": \"According to credible sources, Morris's academic pursuits took her to Durham University, where she laid the foundation for her future success as a historian.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 478, \"end\": 637, \"text\": \"This revelation sheds new light on the formative years of Morris's academic career, which has been marked by significant contributions to the field of history.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 638, \"end\": 641, \"text\": \"Dr.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 642, \"end\": 851, \"text\": \"Emma Taylor, a colleague of Morris's and a fellow historian, corroborated this claim, stating, \\\"Marilyn's time at Durham University was instrumental in shaping her approach to historical research and analysis.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 852, \"end\": 993, \"text\": \"Her experience at the university undoubtedly influenced her subsequent work and helped her develop into the esteemed historian she is today.\\\"\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 994, \"end\": 1102, \"text\": \"A review of Morris's academic credentials and publications reveals a strong connection to Durham University.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1103, \"end\": 1280, \"text\": \"Her early research papers and articles, which focused on British history, demonstrate a deep understanding of the subject matter, likely honed during her time at the university.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1281, \"end\": 1351, \"text\": \"Data from Durham University's alumni records also supports this claim.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1352, \"end\": 1402, \"text\": \"According to the university's archives, Marilyn A.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1403, \"end\": 1505, \"text\": \"Morris was indeed a student at the institution, where she pursued her undergraduate degree in history.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1506, \"end\": 1715, \"text\": \"\\\"Marilyn's attendance at Durham University is a testament to the university's rich academic heritage and its ability to nurture talented scholars,\\\" said Professor James Smith, a historian at Durham University.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1716, \"end\": 1842, \"text\": \"\\\"We are proud to count her among our alumni and recognize the significant contributions she has made to the field of history.\\\"\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 13, \"text\": \"As Marilyn A.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 14, \"end\": 219, \"text\": \"Morris sat in her cluttered office, surrounded by stacks of dusty tomes and scattered notes, she couldn't help but think back to the days that shaped her into the renowned American historian she was today.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 220, \"end\": 430, \"text\": \"Her mind wandered to the sun-drenched campus of the University of Maryland, Baltimore County, where she spent countless hours pouring over historical texts and debating with her peers in the humid Maryland air.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 431, \"end\": 629, \"text\": \"It was on one of those sweltering summer afternoons, while sipping sweet tea on the patio of the university's student union, that Marilyn first stumbled upon her passion for the American Revolution.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 630, \"end\": 663, \"text\": \"Her professor, the inimitable Dr.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 664, \"end\": 765, \"text\": \"Thompson, had assigned a particularly challenging essay on the role of women in the Continental Army.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 766, \"end\": 942, \"text\": \"As Marilyn delved deeper into her research, she became fascinated by the stories of ordinary women who had played extraordinary roles in shaping the course of American history.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 943, \"end\": 1077, \"text\": \"One such woman was Deborah Sampson, a Massachusetts native who had disguised herself as a man to fight alongside the Continental Army.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1078, \"end\": 1328, \"text\": \"Marilyn was captivated by Deborah's bravery and cunning, and she spent hours poring over primary sources, imagining the conversations Deborah might have had with her comrades, and the secrets she might have kept hidden beneath her masculine disguise.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1329, \"end\": 1476, \"text\": \"As the sun began to set on the UMBC campus, Marilyn would often take long walks along the winding paths that crisscrossed the university's grounds.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1477, \"end\": 1738, \"text\": \"She loved the way the setting sun cast a golden glow over the modernist architecture, and the way the sounds of the campus – the chatter of students, the rustling of leaves, and the distant hum of the Baltimore Beltway – blended together in a symphony of sound.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1739, \"end\": 1942, \"text\": \"It was on one of those walks, lost in thought as she pondered the intricacies of Deborah Sampson's story, that Marilyn stumbled upon a small, hidden courtyard tucked away behind the university's library.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1943, \"end\": 2060, \"text\": \"The courtyard was a tranquil oasis, surrounded by towering trees and filled with the sweet scent of blooming flowers.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2061, \"end\": 2181, \"text\": \"Marilyn felt an instant sense of connection to the space, as if she had stumbled upon a hidden piece of her own history.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2182, \"end\": 2344, \"text\": \"From that day on, the courtyard became Marilyn's sanctuary, a place where she could escape the chaos of academic life and lose herself in the stories of the past.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"card_id\": \"d1:c1\", \"entity\": \"Marilyn A. Morris\", \"scope\": \"field of study at Durham University\", \"claim\": \"Marilyn A. Morris pursued an undergraduate degree in history at Durham University.\", \"answer\": \"undergraduate degree in history\", \"quote\": \"Morris was indeed a student at the institution, where she pursued her undergraduate degree in history.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"Marilyn A. Morris\", \"scope\": \"education\", \"claim\": \"Marilyn A. Morris attended the University of Maryland, Baltimore County.\", \"answer\": \"University of Maryland, Baltimore County\", \"quote\": \"Her mind wandered to the sun-drenched campus of the University of Maryland, Baltimore County, where she spent countless hours pouring over historical texts and debating with her peers in the humid Maryland air.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Durham University\", \"University of Maryland, Baltimore County\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Durham University\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"University of Maryland, Baltimore County\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
